   "source": [
    "**Data dictionary**\n",
    "\n",
    "| Variable | Meaning | Type | Known before sending? |\n",
    "|---|---|---|---|\n",
    "| customer_id | customer number | identifier | – |\n",
    "| campaign_id | campaign (CMP3A/B/C) | categorical identifier | yes, but new for every campaign |\n",
    "| channel | email / SMS / push | categorical | yes (campaign design) |\n",
    "| discount | offered discount | numerical (mixed units!) | yes (campaign design) |\n",
    "| previous_orders_12m | orders in last 12 months | numerical | yes |\n",
    "| days_since_last_order | recency | numerical | yes |\n",
    "| avg_basket_eur_12m | average basket value | numerical | yes |\n",
    "| loyalty_tier | Bronze / Silver / Gold | categorical | yes |\n",
    "| campaign_cost_eur | cost of this contact | numerical | recorded afterwards |\n",
    "| clicks_after_campaign | clicks after receiving | numerical | **no – after campaign** |\n",
    "| purchase_revenue_after_campaign_eur | revenue after campaign | numerical | **no – after campaign** |\n",
    "| conversion_flag | bought after campaign | binary **target** | – |"
   ]
  },
