   "source": [
    "**Data-quality findings** (observed here, fixed in Phase 3)\n",
    "\n",
    "| Concern | Variable | Evidence | Why it matters | Decision |\n",
    "|---|---|---|---|---|\n",
    "| Duplicates | all | 4 exact duplicate rows | same customer counted twice | D1 |\n",
    "| Inconsistent categories | channel, loyalty_tier | 6 channel spellings for 3 channels; Gold/gold | one group split into several dummies | D2 |\n",
    "| Mixed units | discount | 0.05/0.10/0.15 next to 5/10/15 | 15% would look 100× larger than 0.15 | D3 |\n",
    "| Impossible values | campaign_cost_eur | 6 negative costs | understate campaign cost | D4 |\n",
    "| Missing values | avg_basket_eur_12m | 18 missing (0.6%), all customers with ≥3 orders | model cannot use missing values | D6 |\n",
    "| Inconsistent records | previous_orders_12m vs avg_basket | 18 customers with 0 orders but a basket > 0 | unclear which field is wrong; kept and noted as limitation | – |"
   ]
  },
