    "**Model comparison at 12% capacity (370 of 3,082 customers contacted)**\n",
    "- Random selection reaches ≈20 converters (5.4% precision).\n",
    "- The recency rule reaches **30** converters (8.1% precision, 1.54× the base rate).\n",
